Pos niki:xmattok ne: witswa:wkilit, a:mo semi wehkapania. Telwehkapan mochi:wa se: *metro** sah.
<Sync time="13.987"/>
Wa:n pos niki:xmati neh pero a:mo ke:man nikwa *porque** witsyoh wa:n
<Sync time="18.844"/>
seki kihtowah kikwah kichih..., kimanah,
<Sync time="21.768"/>
